[38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Approach [39m[49m

[1m[38;5;231mWhich approach should I design in detail?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: Native ES modules (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246msession.mjs / auth.mjs / app.mjs, script type=module, tested with node --test. Zero dependencies, explicit imports,
[39m     [38;5;246mno build step. Renames app.js and edits one script tag.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Globals + dual-export shim
     [38;5;246mSmallest diff, nothing renamed. Costs a module/global shim and positional script-tag ordering that every future [39m
     [38;5;246mpage must get right.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: Add pub/sub on top
     [38;5;246mEither wiring plus subscribe/notify. I recommend against it — separate page loads read once at startup, so [39m
     [38;5;246msubscriptions do not pay off yet.[39m
